WEBVTT

01:30.566 --> 01:31.551
=Tigers Sniff the Rose=

01:31.551 --> 01:33.560
(Based on the novel of the same name by Yiren Kuikui)

01:35.260 --> 01:38.940
=Episode 15=

01:42.980 --> 01:43.980
Shang can definitely be saved now!

01:44.820 --> 01:45.940
How many people in the world

01:46.700 --> 01:47.940
could get His Majesty to issue a pardon?

01:53.460 --> 01:53.860
No.

01:55.220 --> 01:55.620
No, wait.

01:57.580 --> 01:58.580
I can't use this pardon.

02:00.940 --> 02:02.820
If even Father risks protecting him,

02:03.980 --> 02:05.460
Yu Cheng'an will never let him live.

02:06.700 --> 02:07.900
Fang Tong, stop the carriage!

02:11.500 --> 02:12.940
(Prince of Jin refuses to testify.)

02:14.020 --> 02:16.100
(Father's pardon would only
get Yan Shang killed.)

02:18.340 --> 02:20.300
(What other way is there to save him?)

02:22.140 --> 02:22.740
(Yan Shang...)

02:24.220 --> 02:25.460
(How can I save you?)

02:30.340 --> 02:30.740
Wanyao.

02:32.060 --> 02:33.780
I can guess why you've come

02:34.940 --> 02:35.980
to see me today.

02:36.860 --> 02:37.460
However,

02:38.580 --> 02:39.660
I can't go to Yintaimen

02:40.820 --> 02:41.780
and plead for Yan Shang.

02:44.060 --> 02:44.580
That's not why I'm here.

02:47.540 --> 02:49.900
I want you and the Court of Judicial
Review to petition His Majesty

02:50.780 --> 02:51.620
to punish Yan Shang severely.

02:52.180 --> 02:53.500
He must be sentenced to death.

02:55.220 --> 02:56.260
Wait, Wanyao.

02:57.140 --> 02:58.860
Yan Shang may have a sharp tongue,

02:59.220 --> 03:00.460
and perhaps he's made you furious,

03:00.740 --> 03:01.700
but surely not enough to deserve death.

03:02.460 --> 03:03.100
Why not reconsider?

03:03.660 --> 03:04.700
The petition should say

03:04.980 --> 03:06.220
Yan Shang showed contempt for the law

03:06.860 --> 03:08.260
by publicly killing
a senior palace attendant.

03:08.740 --> 03:09.580
His crime is unforgivable.

03:10.100 --> 03:11.020
He should be sentenced at once

03:11.300 --> 03:11.940
and executed immediately.

03:12.780 --> 03:13.780
Don't let your anger
get the better of you.

03:14.900 --> 03:15.620
Isn't Yan Shang

03:16.460 --> 03:17.340
your man?

03:23.220 --> 03:24.100
Yan Shang is my man.

03:25.380 --> 03:27.740
But he's committed such a terrible crime

03:28.580 --> 03:29.780
that I can't protect him anymore.

03:30.940 --> 03:32.100
If he's doomed to die,

03:33.100 --> 03:35.500
why not make his death mean something?

03:38.820 --> 03:39.500
Mean what?

03:42.820 --> 03:44.260
Yu Cheng'an is seizing land
for a hunting ground.

03:44.860 --> 03:46.100
The people of the capital are furious.

03:46.940 --> 03:48.220
But their anger is directed
at Zheng Xing.

03:48.900 --> 03:50.740
He's the one they want dead.

03:51.380 --> 03:52.820
Lord Yu remains safely
behind the scenes.

03:53.820 --> 03:54.820
If I'm right,

03:55.220 --> 03:56.380
once Zheng Xing finishes his work

03:56.780 --> 03:58.100
and provokes public outrage,

03:58.420 --> 03:59.940
Yu Cheng'an will have him killed

04:00.980 --> 04:01.820
to appear just

04:02.100 --> 04:02.940
and calm the public.

04:03.700 --> 04:06.300
But Yan Shang has already
killed Zheng Xing.

04:07.420 --> 04:09.060
If the Court petitions for Yan Shang's
immediate execution,

04:09.740 --> 04:11.020
everyone will realize

04:11.780 --> 04:13.420
that this unjust verdict

04:13.900 --> 04:16.260
is only because Zheng Xing
served Yu Cheng'an.

04:16.940 --> 04:19.340
Then the true culprit
behind the land seizures

04:20.100 --> 04:20.940
and the people's suffering

04:21.620 --> 04:22.580
will be exposed as Yu Cheng'an.

04:24.380 --> 04:26.220
Zheng Xing was meant
to be Yu Cheng'an's scapegoat.

04:27.180 --> 04:28.660
But now that he's dead,

04:29.420 --> 04:30.420
we can pin the blame

04:31.020 --> 04:32.180
squarely on Yu Cheng'an.

04:32.740 --> 04:33.180
Brilliant!

04:35.180 --> 04:35.580
But...

04:35.900 --> 04:37.340
Is there really no way
to save Yan Shang?

04:37.980 --> 04:38.540
What if...

04:38.540 --> 04:39.700
Wanyao's plan is excellent.

04:40.740 --> 04:41.660
You are a master strategist.

04:42.700 --> 04:43.300
You may go now.

04:43.940 --> 04:45.100
I'll instruct the Court
of Judicial Review

04:45.580 --> 04:46.500
to proceed exactly as you suggested.

04:53.580 --> 04:55.460
(Whether this plan succeeds or fails,)

04:56.020 --> 04:57.460
(whether Yan Shang lives or dies,)

04:57.900 --> 04:58.900
(I have nothing to lose.)

04:59.700 --> 05:00.860
(I might as well give it a try.)

05:16.380 --> 05:17.980
Then I'll await your good news.

05:31.060 --> 05:32.380
(You must appear to want Yan Shang dead)

05:33.820 --> 05:35.140
(so he can keep Yan Shang alive.)

05:37.260 --> 05:38.180
(Only then)

05:39.660 --> 05:41.620
(will Yan Shang have a chance
to survive.)

06:13.580 --> 06:14.340
I...

06:15.620 --> 06:16.980
have important information to report.

06:19.060 --> 06:19.420
No need.

06:21.540 --> 06:24.500
It'll only be some fabricated nonsense,

06:25.220 --> 06:26.300
wrapped in clever words,

06:26.740 --> 06:29.020
in a desperate attempt
to save your life.

06:30.100 --> 06:30.820
Save your breath.

06:35.900 --> 06:36.820
Then, Lord Yu,

06:38.460 --> 06:40.060
why have you come today?

06:44.900 --> 06:46.060
You want to know

06:47.340 --> 06:48.780
why I killed Zheng Xing,

06:50.260 --> 06:52.500
and why I publicly

06:53.420 --> 06:54.620
confessed to the crime.

06:57.660 --> 06:58.180
Clever.

06:59.660 --> 07:00.700
I killed Zheng Xing

07:02.380 --> 07:03.860
to protect your reputation.

07:05.460 --> 07:06.460
Flattery.

07:08.020 --> 07:11.900
Zheng Xing terrorized villagers,
seized land, and demolished homes.

07:13.260 --> 07:15.100
Countless families were destroyed.

07:15.900 --> 07:17.380
The people were outraged.

07:19.580 --> 07:20.260
I killed him

07:21.580 --> 07:22.900
not to dispense divine justice,

07:23.700 --> 07:24.820
but to rid the Imperial Court

07:25.780 --> 07:26.820
of a traitor.

07:28.100 --> 07:29.220
And to help you

07:29.940 --> 07:31.540
earn merit and build your reputation.

07:38.900 --> 07:39.340
Merit?

07:41.900 --> 07:42.220
Reputation?

07:44.020 --> 07:44.740
Have I ever had either?

07:46.020 --> 07:47.180
Do I even care?

07:47.820 --> 07:48.500
You do.

07:49.700 --> 07:50.860
And you certainly will care.

07:52.300 --> 07:52.820
After all,

07:54.180 --> 07:56.420
one day, you will hold supreme power.

08:04.540 --> 08:05.380
Utter nonsense!

08:07.980 --> 08:10.220
What absolute nonsense.

08:16.140 --> 08:16.820
Lord Yu,

08:17.540 --> 08:19.740
are you really laughing at my nonsense?

08:21.620 --> 08:24.500
Or at the secret everyone already knows,

08:25.180 --> 08:27.060
which will soon become reality?

08:41.180 --> 08:43.540
Let it be known to all:

08:44.700 --> 08:46.580
I, Yan Shang,

08:47.300 --> 08:49.700
killed Zheng Xing today.

08:51.100 --> 08:54.140
Princess Danyang herself is escorting me

08:55.140 --> 08:56.300
back to the city to surrender.

08:59.580 --> 09:00.580
Those were your words, weren't they?

09:01.140 --> 09:01.620
Yes.

09:24.020 --> 09:24.860
Can you

09:27.100 --> 09:30.220
really draw a bow with over
a one-dan pull?

09:36.660 --> 09:37.540
A scholar

09:39.820 --> 09:41.620
is trained in the Six Arts.

09:44.260 --> 09:45.340
Archery and horsemanship

09:46.260 --> 09:47.060
are no challenge to me.

09:55.020 --> 09:55.500
Good.

09:56.540 --> 09:56.860
Very good.

09:58.900 --> 10:00.460
Then tell me,

10:01.700 --> 10:02.740
why did you

10:03.860 --> 10:05.500
publicly confess to your crime?

10:11.860 --> 10:13.220
I confessed in public

10:15.180 --> 10:16.300
to save my own life.

10:18.300 --> 10:19.540
I'm merely a scholar,

10:21.100 --> 10:22.300
with no influence

10:22.700 --> 10:23.740
and nothing to my name.

10:25.300 --> 10:26.340
To save myself,

10:27.420 --> 10:29.100
I had to use whatever influence I could,

10:30.140 --> 10:31.140
turning to public opinion

10:31.740 --> 10:32.620
and the people's voices

10:33.580 --> 10:34.900
to gamble on a slim chance of survival,

10:37.940 --> 10:39.180
and gamble that you would care.

10:41.340 --> 10:41.700
Good!

10:43.060 --> 10:44.860
Quite the scholar you are.

10:48.340 --> 10:50.620
You dared to manipulate public sentiment

10:51.580 --> 10:52.780
to achieve two goals at once.

10:55.220 --> 10:56.100
Such extraordinary nerve.

12:39.300 --> 12:39.700
Zhang Wencai,

12:40.780 --> 12:42.300
would you sign this petition?

12:43.700 --> 12:44.780
It's a petition seeking clemency

12:44.900 --> 12:46.020
for Yan Shang, the Third-Place Scholar.

12:47.180 --> 12:47.620
I know.

12:50.180 --> 12:51.620
(Zhang Wencai)

12:52.140 --> 12:53.020
I'm a scholar of the classics.

12:53.380 --> 12:54.860
I'm not afraid of those
scheming scoundrels.

12:55.380 --> 12:55.860
But

12:56.700 --> 12:57.660
a petition signed by

12:57.660 --> 12:59.100
a few hundred students
in the Imperial Academy

12:59.820 --> 13:00.860
may not carry enough weight.

13:02.300 --> 13:02.780
Fellow scholars!

13:03.420 --> 13:04.820
Come sign the petition!

13:05.060 --> 13:05.780
(All right! We'll all sign!)

13:05.780 --> 13:06.180
(All right!)

13:06.940 --> 13:07.340
(I'll sign too!)

13:08.860 --> 13:09.340
(Let me sign first!)

13:10.460 --> 13:11.100
(Count me in!)

13:11.260 --> 13:11.660
Thank you.

13:12.900 --> 13:13.300
(It's the least we can do.)

13:13.300 --> 13:13.660
Thank you!

13:13.860 --> 13:14.180
(My turn!)

13:14.580 --> 13:14.860
(Of course!)

13:14.860 --> 13:15.420
Thank you, everyone!

13:15.700 --> 13:16.220
(I'll sign too!)

13:17.380 --> 13:17.780
(Me too!)

13:17.900 --> 13:20.220
(Lin Mei)

13:22.300 --> 13:23.620
When Yan Shang returned to the city,

13:24.340 --> 13:25.380
I saw many commoners following him.

13:25.700 --> 13:26.740
Why don't we seek them out

13:27.060 --> 13:28.900
and submit a petition signed
by the people?

13:29.460 --> 13:30.020
Good idea!

13:31.420 --> 13:31.980
Brilliant!

13:31.980 --> 13:32.540
(It's our duty!)

13:32.540 --> 13:33.300
A people's petition.

13:33.300 --> 13:34.060
- (Exactly!)
- (That's right!)

13:35.140 --> 13:36.260
Prince of Jin is recovering
from his injuries.

13:36.460 --> 13:37.820
He's clearly determined
to stay in hiding.

13:38.340 --> 13:39.300
There's no movement
at the palace either.

13:39.940 --> 13:42.020
His Majesty spends his days
playing chess with Chancellor Liu,

13:42.260 --> 13:43.740
as though he hasn't heard
about the matter.

13:44.100 --> 13:46.300
Or perhaps he's pretending not to know.

13:47.340 --> 13:49.860
The princess has refused all visitors
these past few days.

13:50.020 --> 13:51.940
She's lost her newly acquired
male favorite.

13:52.100 --> 13:52.700
By now,

13:53.220 --> 13:54.860
she's probably grieving all alone.

13:55.580 --> 13:57.220
But the Crown Prince's
reaction this time

13:57.980 --> 13:58.820
is rather interesting.

14:02.980 --> 14:05.460
Those foolish Imperial Academy
students keep making a fuss.

14:05.580 --> 14:07.100
They're planning some kind of
people's petition.

14:07.340 --> 14:08.380
Are we just going to ignore them?

14:08.540 --> 14:09.300
Do nothing at all?

14:10.060 --> 14:10.940
Imperial Academy students

14:11.940 --> 14:13.740
speaking up for the people...

14:14.540 --> 14:16.140
Isn't that the very spirit
of a true scholar?

14:20.500 --> 14:21.860
There's nothing to worry about.

14:22.220 --> 14:24.180
Even if the Emperor himself
issues a pardon,

14:24.180 --> 14:25.540
I couldn't care less.

14:25.980 --> 14:28.020
Let them petition all they want.

14:29.700 --> 14:30.780
Zidu, continue.

14:31.660 --> 14:33.020
The Court of Judicial Review
submitted a petition yesterday,

14:33.020 --> 14:34.980
calling Zheng Xing a pillar
of the imperial court

14:35.140 --> 14:36.100
who was unjustly murdered.

14:36.340 --> 14:38.220
Yan Shang's crime is unforgivable.

14:38.500 --> 14:39.700
They demand an immediate sentence

14:40.180 --> 14:40.860
and swift execution.

14:41.420 --> 14:42.460
Isn't that perfect?

14:43.060 --> 14:44.380
Even the Court of Judicial Review
has spoken.

14:44.700 --> 14:46.500
I say we execute the fellow

14:46.780 --> 14:47.700
before things get complicated.

14:50.740 --> 14:51.700
You foolish boy.

14:52.300 --> 14:53.820
Yan Shang is in Yintaimen.

14:54.180 --> 14:55.500
If we execute him
for killing Zheng Xing,

14:55.620 --> 14:58.260
Lord Yu would inherit all
the public hatred Zheng Xing earned.

14:58.980 --> 14:59.740
Then,

15:00.140 --> 15:03.460
Lord Yu will be branded the greatest
villain who oppresses the people.

15:05.860 --> 15:08.420
The Crown Prince has played
quite a clever trick.

15:08.700 --> 15:09.820
The heir to the throne,

15:10.340 --> 15:11.380
yet so vicious.

15:12.060 --> 15:14.620
The Crown Prince is truly devious!

15:18.220 --> 15:18.820
But Father,

15:20.300 --> 15:21.260
since when have you

15:21.900 --> 15:24.100
cared what the common people think?

15:25.220 --> 15:26.780
Times have changed.

15:27.860 --> 15:28.420
And tomorrow

15:29.380 --> 15:30.820
will still be different.

15:32.660 --> 15:33.060
Father,

15:34.340 --> 15:35.380
tell me what to do.

15:35.740 --> 15:37.940
How should we handle this?

15:39.100 --> 15:39.980
Yan Shang...

15:40.700 --> 15:41.580
Should we execute him

15:42.220 --> 15:43.060
or release him?

15:45.180 --> 15:45.860
In a few days,

15:47.060 --> 15:49.260
just say the case is closed.

15:50.900 --> 15:51.660
Let him go.

15:52.140 --> 15:52.540
Father,

15:52.820 --> 15:54.380
we had grounds to arrest him.

15:54.540 --> 15:56.100
We need grounds to release him too.

15:56.500 --> 15:57.380
What do you suggest?

15:58.020 --> 15:59.540
Didn't you just say

16:00.140 --> 16:02.580
the Imperial Academy students
were petitioning for the people?

16:10.620 --> 16:13.620
Moved by the people's pleas,

16:15.700 --> 16:16.580
Yintaimen conducted
a thorough investigation

16:17.060 --> 16:18.020
and uncovered the truth.

16:18.620 --> 16:19.820
Zheng Xing deserved his fate.

16:20.220 --> 16:21.060
Yan Shang is innocent.

16:21.500 --> 16:21.980
Clever.

16:22.580 --> 16:23.740
But you're missing one line.

16:24.220 --> 16:26.020
We were not swayed by the Crown Prince.

16:27.780 --> 16:28.180
Understood.

16:28.820 --> 16:29.700
I'll see to it at once.

16:30.380 --> 16:31.100
One moment, sir.

16:32.940 --> 16:34.260
Remember to tell
the Investigation Office

16:34.460 --> 16:35.460
to treat Yan Shang's injuries

16:36.380 --> 16:37.260
and keep him alive.

16:37.500 --> 16:39.860
Don't release him until the bruises
on his hands and face have faded.

16:41.180 --> 16:42.260
On the day of his release,

16:42.740 --> 16:43.620
give him a bath,

16:43.860 --> 16:44.940
dress him in clean clothes,

16:45.420 --> 16:46.060
then send him out.

16:46.380 --> 16:48.940
Don't worry. I'll find him
the finest clothes!

16:54.820 --> 17:00.020
(Ten Days Later)

17:18.180 --> 17:19.060
(I think that's really him.)

17:20.500 --> 17:20.860
(Yintaimen)
Shang!

17:21.460 --> 17:21.900
Yan Shang!

17:22.180 --> 17:22.540
(Yan Shang!)

17:23.660 --> 17:24.020
Yan Shang!

17:24.820 --> 17:25.220
Wei Shu.

17:30.700 --> 17:31.140
I am

17:32.100 --> 17:32.940
deeply grateful to you all!

17:33.220 --> 17:35.220
(Yintaimen)

17:35.220 --> 17:36.180
Well, look at you, Yan Shang!

17:36.460 --> 17:37.860
After all those days at Yintaimen,

17:37.860 --> 17:38.740
you actually made it out alive!

17:39.180 --> 17:39.900
You've got nine lives!

17:41.820 --> 17:42.420
Let's talk at home.

17:43.580 --> 17:43.900
All right.

17:44.500 --> 17:44.820
Let's go.

17:47.260 --> 17:48.180
(Thank you! Thank you!)

17:48.180 --> 17:49.300
- (Scholar Yan!)
- (Thank goodness you're safe!)

17:49.300 --> 17:49.900
Thank you. Thank you.

17:49.900 --> 17:50.700
(Glad you're safe!)

17:50.700 --> 17:51.340
Thank you, everyone.

17:51.860 --> 17:52.340
Thank you.

17:52.820 --> 17:53.460
Thank you, everyone.

17:54.060 --> 17:54.700
- (Thank you.)
- Thank you.

17:55.180 --> 17:55.980
(Thank you.)

18:06.580 --> 18:07.060
Your Highness.

18:08.340 --> 18:09.180
You've saved my life again.

18:14.740 --> 18:15.700
My legs have gone numb.

18:18.300 --> 18:18.700
Completely numb.

18:19.220 --> 18:20.060
Now you know what pain feels like?

18:30.700 --> 18:31.500
Those monsters!

18:32.820 --> 18:33.380
It's all right.

18:34.060 --> 18:35.260
They're just superficial wounds.

18:35.620 --> 18:37.100
You nearly died! Do you realize that?

18:45.900 --> 18:48.260
I killed Zheng Xing to seek justice
for the people.

18:49.060 --> 18:49.820
After I was imprisoned,

18:50.100 --> 18:51.460
the people sought justice for me.

18:51.900 --> 18:53.140
It all worked out for the best.

18:53.940 --> 18:54.460
Your Highness,

18:55.140 --> 18:55.980
shouldn't you be happy?

19:00.060 --> 19:00.460
Listen.

19:01.020 --> 19:02.260
(It's all thanks to Scholar Yan.)

19:10.940 --> 19:12.860
(Who else would've stood up for us
but Scholar Yan?)

19:12.940 --> 19:14.140
(It's all thanks to Scholar Yan.)

19:14.940 --> 19:16.020
(What a good man.)

19:18.860 --> 19:19.980
To see so many people happy

19:20.540 --> 19:21.500
in times like these...

19:22.420 --> 19:23.580
How rare that is.

19:30.140 --> 19:31.300
I risked my life to get through this.

19:32.340 --> 19:32.820
From now on,

19:33.460 --> 19:34.540
the road ahead will be much smoother.

19:35.180 --> 19:36.540
I'll be able to do more for you.

19:37.700 --> 19:39.340
If that's what you expect of me,

19:40.300 --> 19:40.860
if...

19:42.180 --> 19:43.900
if that's the only thing
I can do for you...

19:46.900 --> 19:48.220
I'd rather you did nothing at all.

19:48.820 --> 19:49.580
Just stay alive.

19:50.300 --> 19:51.420
Go back to Lingnan and farm your land.

19:52.580 --> 19:54.540
Your future, the people's cheers,

19:54.820 --> 19:55.820
your so-called perfect outcome...

19:56.300 --> 19:57.580
Are any of those worth
more than your life?

19:59.100 --> 20:00.180
If you weren't so tough

20:00.740 --> 20:01.580
and incredibly lucky,

20:02.060 --> 20:04.260
you'd already be another
innocent soul dead at Yintaimen.

20:05.180 --> 20:06.580
Can't you see what really matters?

20:07.140 --> 20:08.140
What on earth were you thinking?

20:13.540 --> 20:13.980
But...

20:16.140 --> 20:17.260
You matter more than any of that.

20:21.260 --> 20:22.980
I can't bear to watch you
risk your life like this.

20:28.980 --> 20:29.460
Your Highness,

20:31.220 --> 20:32.420
we once sealed our vow with blood.

20:33.620 --> 20:34.660
No matter when or where,

20:35.220 --> 20:36.860
no matter how you feel about me,

20:38.020 --> 20:38.980
my feelings for you

20:39.900 --> 20:40.700
will never change.

20:43.780 --> 20:45.660
You can still think of me
as your adviser.

20:46.900 --> 20:47.900
I'll always stay by your side,

20:49.020 --> 20:49.940
protect you from harm,

20:50.820 --> 20:51.940
and remain within your reach,

20:52.860 --> 20:53.980
right where you can see me,

20:55.020 --> 20:55.780
always waiting for you.

20:59.820 --> 21:00.700
Whenever you're ready,

21:01.900 --> 21:03.060
you can tell me anything.

21:05.780 --> 21:07.140
I want to share your burdens.

21:12.500 --> 21:12.940
Yan Shang.

21:14.980 --> 21:15.660
Those words...

21:16.700 --> 21:17.460
That was beautifully said.

21:19.660 --> 21:20.180
Thank you.

21:20.180 --> 21:22.820
♪Let's conspire to grow old together♪

21:22.820 --> 21:23.380
But...

21:25.460 --> 21:27.020
I'm not a little girl anymore.

21:28.780 --> 21:30.380
A few sweet words won't make me

21:31.660 --> 21:32.580
throw caution to the wind.

21:32.580 --> 21:36.220
♪However deep the snow,
I'll wait if you're there♪

21:36.220 --> 21:39.900
♪However deep the snow,
I'll wait if you're there♪

21:40.020 --> 21:40.460
You're right.

21:41.060 --> 21:41.820
Words alone prove nothing.

21:43.140 --> 21:44.100
But I'll wait for the day

21:45.140 --> 21:46.140
when you finally believe me.

21:47.180 --> 21:52.780
♪Sharp winds or fierce rain,
nothing can break us♪

21:52.780 --> 21:53.220
All right.

21:54.380 --> 21:57.740
♪Be my one and only in this world;
be my one and only in this life♪

21:57.860 --> 22:01.220
♪My last untouched innocence♪

22:01.860 --> 22:04.260
(Imperial Physician Huang;
Palace Medical Service)

22:04.980 --> 22:06.020
Lie down!

22:09.460 --> 22:10.020
Imperial Physician Huang,

22:10.580 --> 22:11.100
take his pulse.

22:12.220 --> 22:12.700
Yes, Your Highness.

22:28.300 --> 22:30.020
Stay in bed and rest
for the next few days.

22:30.500 --> 22:32.220
This is Imperial Physician Huang
from the Imperial Medical Office.

22:32.620 --> 22:33.500
Every five days,

22:33.740 --> 22:35.060
he'll come to check your pulse

22:35.580 --> 22:36.340
and adjust your prescription.

22:36.820 --> 22:37.900
Take your medicine properly.

22:38.780 --> 22:40.300
Otherwise, you could suffer
lasting damage

22:41.060 --> 22:41.940
and regret it for the rest of your life.

22:44.420 --> 22:45.180
Thank you, Your Highness.

22:48.540 --> 22:50.180
Then you'd better think carefully

22:51.220 --> 22:52.260
about how you're going to thank me.

23:10.020 --> 23:10.860
Thank you for your trouble,
Imperial Physician Huang.

24:05.820 --> 24:06.220
Yan Shang!

24:06.940 --> 24:07.540
Are you home?

24:09.260 --> 24:09.980
Still alive?

24:10.980 --> 24:11.420
Who's there?

24:12.700 --> 24:13.340
Oh, someone's home!

24:14.180 --> 24:14.980
I'm coming in, then.

24:19.780 --> 24:20.580
You can walk already?

24:23.340 --> 24:23.820
Who's this?

24:24.300 --> 24:25.220
I should be asking you that!

24:25.580 --> 24:26.660
The host hasn't invited you in,

24:26.740 --> 24:27.700
yet you just barged right in!

24:30.740 --> 24:31.220
Yang Si,

24:31.900 --> 24:32.340
this is

24:32.860 --> 24:33.540
my friend,

24:34.020 --> 24:34.740
Liu Wenji.

24:35.540 --> 24:36.020
Wenji.

24:37.060 --> 24:37.540
This is...

24:41.180 --> 24:42.060
also my friend.

24:45.180 --> 24:45.980
I came looking for Wanyao.

24:46.820 --> 24:47.700
She's not at her residence.

24:47.860 --> 24:48.740
I thought perhaps...

24:50.380 --> 24:51.380
She's not here either.

25:00.020 --> 25:01.780
When people were trying to save you,

25:02.260 --> 25:03.180
they drew up a petition.

25:04.500 --> 25:05.540
I signed it too, you know.

25:07.140 --> 25:07.860
Thank you, Yang Si.

25:09.020 --> 25:10.140
I never expected

25:10.620 --> 25:11.620
that piece of paper to actually work.

25:13.460 --> 25:13.900
Third-Place Scholar,

25:14.180 --> 25:15.460
aren't you great with words?

25:15.820 --> 25:17.060
Write an anonymous denunciation

25:17.300 --> 25:17.980
and tear Yu Cheng'an to shreds!

25:18.820 --> 25:19.260
He mustn't!

25:20.220 --> 25:21.620
Yintaimen's spies are everywhere.

25:22.140 --> 25:22.660
If he's discovered,

25:22.980 --> 25:23.740
Shang may lose his life.

25:26.020 --> 25:29.100
Only heaven and the three of us
would know.

25:30.340 --> 25:31.020
If someone reports him,

25:31.620 --> 25:32.780
it must have been you.

25:32.780 --> 25:33.060
Me?

25:33.940 --> 25:34.940
Why would I ever betray Shang?

25:35.100 --> 25:36.100
Why wouldn't you?

25:36.700 --> 25:38.100
You never know someone's
true intentions.

25:38.100 --> 25:39.620
You're the one with suspicious motives.

25:39.620 --> 25:41.020
How am I the suspicious one?

25:41.020 --> 25:42.100
You started it!

25:42.340 --> 25:43.820
You can't just accuse me!
What do you mean, I started it?

25:43.820 --> 25:44.980
- How am I accusing you?
- You said it first!

25:44.980 --> 25:46.660
Enough! Both of you, stop arguing.

25:46.900 --> 25:47.380
Yan Shang!

25:48.060 --> 25:48.660
Are you home?

25:52.780 --> 25:53.980
It's quite lively here today!

25:54.900 --> 25:56.140
(This is Yan Shang's home.)

25:56.140 --> 25:57.260
I went to the Imperial Academy today.

25:57.660 --> 25:59.140
The Academy Director asked me
to give you this letter.

25:59.140 --> 25:59.740
(You're just as loud.)

25:59.740 --> 26:00.300
He also said...

26:00.420 --> 26:00.820
(Why do you keep picking on me?)

26:00.820 --> 26:01.700
he was delivering it for someone else.

26:01.900 --> 26:03.300
- (Why would Shang befriend...)
- (What do you mean?)

26:03.620 --> 26:04.780
(Go on, say it! I dare you!)

26:05.300 --> 26:05.900
(I won't argue with you.)

26:06.500 --> 26:07.340
(Yan Shang hasn't fully recovered.)

26:07.660 --> 26:08.180
(He needs peace and quiet.)

26:08.180 --> 26:09.220
(You're just losing the argument!)

26:09.220 --> 26:11.820
(When shall we play Go together again?)

26:12.380 --> 26:15.540
(Surely you'd like to win one back,
young man?)

26:15.940 --> 26:18.500
(Liu Residence, Southeast Xuanyang Ward)

26:19.420 --> 26:20.260
(It's Chancellor Liu.)

26:20.780 --> 26:21.860
(He must want to see me
about something.)

26:23.780 --> 26:24.500
Thank you, Wei Shu.

26:25.060 --> 26:25.860
I need to go out.

26:25.940 --> 26:29.660
(Liu Residence)

26:29.660 --> 26:31.020
I, Yan Shang, request an audience.

26:32.780 --> 26:33.660
Come up.

27:07.180 --> 27:07.700
Chancellor Liu,

27:08.460 --> 27:09.140
I hope you've been well.

27:12.620 --> 27:14.260
Have you recovered

27:14.620 --> 27:15.500
from your injuries at Yintaimen?

27:16.020 --> 27:16.660
I'm fine now.

27:22.700 --> 27:24.180
I regret my decision.

27:28.060 --> 27:29.140
Do you regret

27:29.780 --> 27:30.780
inviting me to play Go?

27:31.380 --> 27:32.700
I regret stopping

27:33.460 --> 27:35.660
a reckless little brat like you

27:36.300 --> 27:38.900
from leaving that day!

27:42.220 --> 27:43.380
That day outside the city,

27:43.900 --> 27:46.060
you had two choices, leave or stay.

27:46.820 --> 27:48.100
You chose to stay.

27:49.860 --> 27:51.380
What exactly are you
trying to accomplish?

27:55.820 --> 27:56.660
With traitors ruling the realm,

27:57.660 --> 27:59.660
if I merely avenged
my personal grievance

27:59.940 --> 28:00.900
and withdrew into seclusion,

28:02.060 --> 28:03.340
I'd contribute nothing in life

28:03.940 --> 28:05.020
and leave no legacy in death.

28:05.820 --> 28:06.660
Wouldn't that be shameful?

28:07.860 --> 28:09.060
Then let me ask you,

28:09.820 --> 28:11.300
once you enter official service,

28:11.860 --> 28:12.780
what do you intend to do?

28:13.380 --> 28:14.020
Punish the tyrants.

28:14.660 --> 28:15.340
Restore order.

28:16.180 --> 28:16.660
Serve the people.

28:17.300 --> 28:17.820
Uphold justice.

28:18.820 --> 28:19.420
Practice benevolence.

28:20.540 --> 28:21.060
Serve the common good.

28:21.660 --> 28:23.740
Yet you act so recklessly!

28:24.420 --> 28:25.700
You don't know when to hold back,

28:26.220 --> 28:27.620
bringing disaster upon yourself.

28:28.500 --> 28:31.140
You nearly died in prison

28:31.860 --> 28:33.260
just to kill an insignificant
Zheng Xing.

28:34.060 --> 28:35.860
What right have you
to speak of such ideals?

28:37.820 --> 28:38.380
I...

28:39.460 --> 28:40.540
I had a plan

28:42.100 --> 28:42.820
before I acted.

28:43.980 --> 28:44.860
Though it was dangerous,

28:45.460 --> 28:46.380
there was still a chance of survival.

28:47.060 --> 28:48.220
That's why I made that choice.

28:48.980 --> 28:50.140
A chance of survival?

28:52.780 --> 28:56.500
You mean the signatures of hundreds
of Imperial Academy students

28:57.220 --> 29:00.020
and the fingerprints of thousands
of commoners?

29:03.300 --> 29:03.780
Yes.

29:04.060 --> 29:05.420
You planned all along

29:05.980 --> 29:07.260
to stir up public opinion

29:07.740 --> 29:09.380
and use it to save yourself?

29:10.300 --> 29:10.660
Yes.

29:15.580 --> 29:17.580
You manipulated the people's trust.

29:17.700 --> 29:19.700
That makes you deceitful
and treacherous,

29:20.380 --> 29:22.140
even worse than a reckless fool!

29:23.700 --> 29:24.740
Please enlighten me, Chancellor.

29:25.540 --> 29:27.220
Yan Shang, Yan Shang...

29:28.580 --> 29:29.940
The hearts and minds of the people

29:30.420 --> 29:33.500
won't always bend to your calculations.

29:34.180 --> 29:35.540
One wrong move,

29:36.140 --> 29:38.700
and you'll meet a terrible end!

29:43.820 --> 29:46.540
You certainly have a calculating mind,

29:47.620 --> 29:48.900
just like your style of Go.

29:49.500 --> 29:51.220
Your moves seem conventional,

29:51.780 --> 29:53.900
then suddenly catch me off guard

29:54.140 --> 29:55.540
with a daring, risky move.

29:57.940 --> 29:58.940
You're too kind, Chancellor.

29:59.980 --> 30:01.860
It's too early to be modest!

30:02.660 --> 30:03.220
Yan Shang,

30:03.940 --> 30:05.340
you're exceptionally intelligent,

30:05.620 --> 30:06.660
yet when we play Go,

30:07.260 --> 30:09.620
you lose far more often than you win.

30:10.660 --> 30:12.740
Have you ever wondered why?

30:14.100 --> 30:15.940
Your style is steady and measured.

30:16.580 --> 30:18.060
You often even yield ground to me.

30:18.660 --> 30:19.180
But...

30:20.380 --> 30:21.540
But by the end of the game,

30:24.220 --> 30:25.020
I always discover

30:25.340 --> 30:26.900
that your white stones
form a dense forest,

30:27.180 --> 30:27.780
a treacherous swamp,

30:28.980 --> 30:30.220
and have already trapped

30:31.140 --> 30:31.980
my black stones beyond escape.

30:33.540 --> 30:35.940
Sometimes cleverness
becomes your downfall.

30:37.100 --> 30:40.140
Better to take steady steps,
even if you seem foolish.

30:42.620 --> 30:43.740
Thank you for your guidance, Chancellor.

30:45.020 --> 30:45.900
You've taught me the way of Go.

30:47.580 --> 30:48.380
Be patient now

30:49.180 --> 30:50.140
for the sake of the long game.

30:52.260 --> 30:53.100
I understand.

30:53.300 --> 30:54.820
Is that all you've learned?

30:57.260 --> 30:58.980
When I called you back that day,

30:59.900 --> 31:01.620
I wasn't entirely certain
of my decision.

31:02.420 --> 31:03.620
With a mind like yours,

31:04.180 --> 31:05.780
if you turned to evil,

31:06.340 --> 31:08.260
you'd become a grave threat
to the realm.

31:10.740 --> 31:11.740
So I thought,

31:12.580 --> 31:13.380
this young man...

31:13.860 --> 31:16.620
I must put him to the test.

31:20.060 --> 31:20.620
Then...

31:21.540 --> 31:23.020
what's your verdict, Chancellor?

31:24.660 --> 31:25.740
You little rascal...

31:31.020 --> 31:31.500
You passed.

31:37.700 --> 31:38.180
Chancellor,

31:39.300 --> 31:40.180
I've always believed

31:40.580 --> 31:41.380
that not everyone in
or outside the Court

31:41.660 --> 31:43.020
is a vile scoundrel.

31:44.100 --> 31:46.060
If we can rid the realm of lackeys
like Zheng Xing,

31:46.620 --> 31:47.780
and even the predators behind them,

31:48.660 --> 31:49.180
the Huai Dynasty

31:50.100 --> 31:51.820
will one day be free of corruption.

31:58.620 --> 32:00.180
Why are you still standing?

32:01.260 --> 32:03.820
Haven't your injuries from Yintaimen
healed yet?

32:13.180 --> 32:13.700
Master,

32:14.580 --> 32:15.540
I, Yan Shang,

32:16.100 --> 32:16.980
pay my respects to you.

32:40.060 --> 32:40.700
Very good!

32:41.300 --> 32:41.900
Rise.

32:42.740 --> 32:44.060
From this day forward,

32:44.700 --> 32:46.820
you shall be my disciple.

32:47.900 --> 32:48.460
Yan Shang,

32:48.940 --> 32:49.700
do you have a courtesy name?

32:50.300 --> 32:51.180
Not yet, Master.

32:53.420 --> 32:54.620
The character "Shang"

32:54.860 --> 32:55.940
signifies aspiration

32:56.420 --> 32:57.540
and the will to help others.

32:58.980 --> 32:59.820
Then your courtesy name

33:00.540 --> 33:01.420
shall be Suchen.

33:02.420 --> 33:03.900
May you stay true to your principles

33:04.460 --> 33:06.660
and serve Confucius, the Uncrowned King.

33:09.100 --> 33:09.900
Thank you, Master.

33:12.500 --> 33:13.140
Sit down.

33:14.620 --> 33:15.580
Finish this game

33:16.220 --> 33:18.060
of Go with your master.

33:20.300 --> 33:20.700
Yes, Master.

33:43.460 --> 33:44.300
Imperial Physician Huang,
a moment, please.

33:45.500 --> 33:46.380
Miss Chunhua.

33:46.900 --> 33:48.580
Does the princess
have further instructions?

33:49.540 --> 33:50.380
It's not the princess.

33:52.460 --> 33:53.020
Imperial Physician Huang,

33:54.340 --> 33:55.140
could you please

33:55.780 --> 33:56.620
take my pulse

33:57.260 --> 33:58.180
before seeing Yan Shang?

33:59.220 --> 33:59.780
Please.

34:00.780 --> 34:02.340
Of course, Miss Chunhua.

34:02.780 --> 34:03.580
Give me your wrist.

34:04.020 --> 34:05.180
Are you feeling unwell?

34:15.660 --> 34:16.300
Imperial Physician Huang,

34:19.500 --> 34:20.340
my period

34:21.500 --> 34:22.500
was due at the start of the month.

34:23.820 --> 34:24.660
But I've been waiting,

34:25.700 --> 34:26.420
and it still hasn't come.

34:27.540 --> 34:28.580
It's nothing to worry about.

34:28.580 --> 34:29.980
You're still young.

34:30.700 --> 34:32.620
Stress or exhaustion
could cause a delay.

34:43.380 --> 34:44.380
(Miss, did you know)

34:46.140 --> 34:47.180
(you're pregnant?)

35:00.780 --> 35:04.540
(Cinnabar, Eucommia Bark, Tin, Mercury)

35:07.100 --> 35:13.540
(Mercury)

35:16.220 --> 35:17.380
(Mercury heated in oil.
And taken as a date-sized pill)

35:19.180 --> 35:20.700
(Mercury)
(on an empty stomach)

35:22.260 --> 35:23.340
(causes permanent infertility.)

35:23.460 --> 35:24.060
It's mercury.

35:46.740 --> 35:47.380
Imperial Physician Huang,

35:47.980 --> 35:48.740
what's happening?

35:52.180 --> 35:52.900
Your Highness,

35:53.580 --> 35:54.540
Miss Chunhua

35:55.460 --> 35:56.900
most likely took

35:56.900 --> 35:58.740
some dangerous medicine
to end her pregnancy,

35:59.420 --> 36:00.980
causing uncontrollable bleeding.

36:02.020 --> 36:02.820
Right now,

36:05.020 --> 36:05.860
her condition is critical.

36:16.300 --> 36:16.860
Chunhua!

36:17.540 --> 36:18.140
Chunhua!

36:20.620 --> 36:21.420
What did you take?

36:24.740 --> 36:25.500
Your Highness...

36:27.860 --> 36:28.940
I...

36:30.860 --> 36:32.060
I did something foolish after all.

36:38.980 --> 36:39.700
Your Highness.

36:42.980 --> 36:43.460
I...

36:45.420 --> 36:46.620
I don't want to die.

36:47.140 --> 36:47.780
Tell me.

36:48.860 --> 36:49.500
Was it...

36:51.140 --> 36:52.300
Was it mercury heated in oil?

36:55.900 --> 36:56.420
Yes.

36:57.940 --> 36:58.740
I'll save you.

36:59.380 --> 37:00.460
I won't let you die.

37:01.220 --> 37:01.780
Imperial Physician Huang.

37:02.380 --> 37:02.860
Come with me.

37:15.260 --> 37:15.860
Chunhua.

37:18.900 --> 37:19.260
Here.

37:47.540 --> 37:48.300
Is this...

37:50.460 --> 37:51.820
from when you were in North Jing?

37:53.820 --> 37:54.100
Yes.

37:55.500 --> 37:56.380
The very same prescription.

37:58.180 --> 37:58.780
Fortunately, this time

37:59.420 --> 38:00.460
we're in Sheng'an.

38:01.420 --> 38:02.340
We have all the ingredients.

38:10.460 --> 38:10.940
Chunhua.

38:12.340 --> 38:14.100
Do you want to save your life
or end the pregnancy?

38:15.460 --> 38:16.100
Your Highness,

38:19.740 --> 38:21.420
I don't want to have a child.

38:24.460 --> 38:25.260
I just want

38:27.380 --> 38:28.740
to stay by your side.

38:34.020 --> 38:34.580
Drink this.

38:46.140 --> 38:48.100
If you want to live, you must drink it.

39:36.700 --> 39:37.300
Your Highness...

39:40.220 --> 39:41.940
Back when you were in North Jing...

39:47.540 --> 39:49.180
I never knew it hurt this much.

40:01.220 --> 40:03.260
Your Highness, the pharmacy
has all the other ingredients.

40:03.420 --> 40:04.940
Only the most important one,
jade poria, is missing!

40:05.300 --> 40:06.300
I slipped out

40:06.660 --> 40:08.420
and searched every pharmacy in the city.
None had it!

40:08.860 --> 40:10.660
They said jade poria doesn't grow
in North Jing.

40:11.900 --> 40:12.860
Your Highness, what do we do?

40:16.500 --> 40:17.860
Go find him, quickly.

40:18.420 --> 40:18.820
All right!

40:19.140 --> 40:19.740
I'll go right now.

40:20.260 --> 40:21.060
Your Highness, wait for me.

40:47.020 --> 40:48.460
This antidote pill made
from jade poria...

40:50.580 --> 40:51.460
I happen to have one.

40:53.420 --> 40:55.580
But if you take this antidote,

40:57.140 --> 40:58.580
it will save your life

41:00.060 --> 41:01.900
and preserve the child in your womb.

41:12.660 --> 41:13.380
Tonight,

41:15.540 --> 41:17.060
only one of us will survive.

41:20.340 --> 41:21.660
And that will be me.

41:24.300 --> 41:24.820
Your Highness.

41:26.180 --> 41:27.100
Your Highness, please don't die.

41:27.660 --> 41:29.140
Don't leave me all alone.

41:30.540 --> 41:31.980
I have to survive.

41:35.500 --> 41:36.620
One day,

41:39.620 --> 41:40.820
I promise I'll take you

41:42.940 --> 41:44.060
away from North Jing

41:44.580 --> 41:45.780
and back to Sheng'an.

41:49.940 --> 41:50.620
Your Highness,

41:53.380 --> 41:54.780
you really did it.

41:57.460 --> 41:58.780
You brought me home.

42:00.260 --> 42:01.860
Even now, I still don't know

42:02.980 --> 42:04.780
how you managed it.

42:07.660 --> 42:08.700
When you've recovered,

42:09.940 --> 42:10.940
ask me again.

42:12.420 --> 42:13.220
Then I'll tell you.

42:22.980 --> 42:23.700
Your Highness,

42:25.020 --> 42:25.980
I feel like

42:27.660 --> 42:29.260
I'm back there again.

42:31.260 --> 42:33.100
On our journey home...

42:35.100 --> 42:36.540
The snow was so heavy.

42:38.980 --> 42:39.860
So cold...

42:46.260 --> 42:47.180
It's such a long way.

42:48.020 --> 42:49.700
Can we really make it back to Sheng'an?

42:50.540 --> 42:51.140
We can.

42:51.460 --> 42:51.900
I...

42:55.260 --> 42:56.180
I can't go on.

42:56.180 --> 43:00.020
♪Into savage lands, to tame tigers
and slay wolves♪

43:00.020 --> 43:01.940
That hunter's trap was so powerful.

43:02.780 --> 43:05.780
I think the bones in my foot are broken.

43:10.780 --> 43:11.380
Your Highness,

43:11.980 --> 43:13.340
I still have some food.

43:13.980 --> 43:14.820
Take it with you.

43:15.620 --> 43:16.940
Maybe if you eat enough,

43:17.540 --> 43:18.300
you'll have the strength to walk faster

43:19.420 --> 43:21.020
and make it back to Sheng'an.

43:25.900 --> 43:26.460
Your Highness,

43:28.260 --> 43:29.700
if you make it back to Sheng'an,

43:30.940 --> 43:32.580
please don't forget me.

43:34.340 --> 43:36.380
Remember to burn some spirit money
for me every year.

43:36.980 --> 43:37.820
My mother said

43:39.100 --> 43:41.020
if no one burns spirit money for you,

43:42.100 --> 43:44.100
you'll become a wandering ghost.

43:45.740 --> 43:49.980
♪With sacrificed innocence
and a soul snowbound♪

43:50.140 --> 43:51.420
♪If the road is blocked,
I'll fight my way through♪

43:51.420 --> 43:51.740
Let's go.

43:52.700 --> 43:55.820
♪Cut down the crowd,
strike down the proud gods♪

43:55.980 --> 43:59.060
♪Break through Hell's gates♪

44:01.100 --> 44:02.980
I really can't take another step.

44:04.260 --> 44:05.060
Go on without me.

44:05.700 --> 44:07.820
Leave me. It'll be dark soon.

44:08.180 --> 44:08.860
Don't be ridiculous.

44:09.460 --> 44:09.780
Come on!

44:14.020 --> 44:17.820
♪Though this world is hard to cross,
I'll lead you through♪

44:17.940 --> 44:20.980
♪I dare face the unknown,
with my sword in hand♪

44:21.260 --> 44:25.980
♪I'll guard my princess,
and keep her tears at bay♪

44:33.300 --> 44:37.100
♪You're my princess,
and I'll take you away♪

44:37.220 --> 44:40.300
♪In this life, we'll bow
only to flowers♪

44:40.540 --> 44:46.380
♪Fierce and radiant,
red lips and dark eyes♪

44:46.660 --> 44:50.700
♪Together we'll climb the city walls♪

45:12.460 --> 45:17.140
(Next Episode Preview)

45:17.460 --> 45:18.500
I've thought of two ways

45:19.220 --> 45:20.580
to keep you out of Yintaimen.

45:21.380 --> 45:22.020
What are they?

45:22.380 --> 45:23.020
The first

45:23.420 --> 45:24.460
is to have Liu Wenji take you away.

45:26.420 --> 45:27.740
What's the second?

45:29.300 --> 45:30.100
Marry the Prince of Jin.

45:31.700 --> 45:32.540
That will save your life.

45:36.080 --> 45:39.373
♪Be the ferry
where you wait for the sun♪

45:42.058 --> 45:46.974
♪Be the blue silk
that catches your tears♪

45:49.168 --> 45:55.013
♪Be the sleeve we held,
worn by dust and years♪

45:55.513 --> 46:00.739
♪Let's conspire to grow old together♪

46:03.508 --> 46:08.299
♪Let me be a captive beast
bound by the same lock as you♪

46:09.135 --> 46:15.214
♪- Through trails of mud and blood;
- let grief drown in your eyes♪

46:17.015 --> 46:20.165
♪Soar with the wind;
plunge into hellfire as one♪

46:20.165 --> 46:21.813
♪Burning bright as a song♪

46:21.865 --> 46:25.589
♪See how roses and green bamboo enchant♪

46:25.967 --> 46:30.633
♪Be the vow I make with all my heart♪

46:31.252 --> 46:35.293
♪If we say forever,
then forever it shall be♪

46:35.784 --> 46:37.899
♪Not a single hour less♪

46:37.939 --> 46:44.885
♪However deep the snow,
I'll wait if you're there♪

46:45.648 --> 46:49.101
♪We'll be gods above,
or wandering souls♪

46:49.281 --> 46:52.426
♪In heaven or the underworld,
you're all I need♪

46:52.865 --> 46:59.502
♪If we can stay, let's return
to the village of our first meeting♪

46:59.899 --> 47:01.937
♪- May time be free of fear;
- boats rock♪

47:01.937 --> 47:04.413
♪- May time be free of pain;
- lights fade, seasons turn♪

47:04.451 --> 47:06.920
♪You're the only one I need♪

47:07.124 --> 47:14.011
♪Sharp winds or fierce rain,
nothing can break us♪

47:14.323 --> 47:17.594
♪Be mine in this world;
be mine in this life♪

47:17.899 --> 47:21.072
♪My last untouched innocence♪

47:21.396 --> 47:24.822
♪If only we could return
to the village where we first met♪

47:25.055 --> 47:28.280
♪Stay by me; help me forget
the frozen dream of last night♪

47:28.611 --> 47:35.407
♪Fireflies glow, flowers kiss our lips;
just us, through dawn and dusk♪

47:35.776 --> 47:37.838
♪- May time be free of fear;
- boats rock♪

47:37.839 --> 47:40.342
♪- May time be free of pain;
- lights fade, seasons turn♪

47:40.389 --> 47:42.727
♪You're the only one I need♪

47:42.958 --> 47:49.793
♪By your side, through joy and pain,
is that eternity?♪

47:50.142 --> 47:51.760
♪Till fireworks flood the town♪

47:51.890 --> 47:53.686
♪Till the lake is still and clear♪

47:54.043 --> 47:57.060
♪You're the only one I need♪

47:57.100 --> 47:58.427
(No animals were harmed
or mistreated in production.)
